      "content": "Increasing your ibuprofen dosage without medical guidance is not recommended and could be unsafe. Even if your doctor advised monitoring, the combination of sudden onset, intense pain, and new weakness warrants closer attention than just resting. Please contact your doctor's office right now to describe *all* your current symptoms for their professional guidance on next steps.",
      "source": "target",
